#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:55
#, sh-format
msgid "The Dagric manual is not installed ($ROOT is missing)."
msgstr "Le manuel Dagric n'est pas installé ($ROOT est absent)."

#. TRANSLATORS: the four indented lines are the command's own syntax and
#. are typed verbatim — "dagric-manual", "--list", "--help" and the example
#. "dolphin" must not be translated. <topic> is a placeholder and may be.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:63
msgid ""
"Dagric manual — every application on this computer, offline.\n"
"\n"
"  dagric-manual              open the front page (search from there)\n"
"  dagric-manual <topic>      open one page, e.g.  dagric-manual dolphin\n"
"  dagric-manual --list       list every topic\n"
"  dagric-manual --help       this text\n"
"\n"
"Topics are matched against PAGE NAMES: \"kate\", \"app-kate\" and \"ate\" "
"all reach\n"
"the Kate page. Windows names do not work here -- \"notepad\" matches no "
"page\n"
"name, so it fails. Search by Windows name in the manual's own search box\n"
"instead; that index is what \"notepad finds Kate\" refers to.\n"
"\n"
"Pages live in /usr/share/dagric/manual and need no internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Manuel Dagric — chaque application de cet ordinateur, hors ligne.\n"
"\n"
"  dagric-manual              ouvrir la page d'accueil (rechercher depuis "
"là)\n"
"  dagric-manual <sujet>      ouvrir une page, ex.  dagric-manual dolphin\n"
"  dagric-manual --list       lister tous les sujets\n"
"  dagric-manual --help       ce texte\n"
"\n"
"Les sujets sont comparés aux NOMS DE PAGES : « kate », « app-kate » et « ate "
"»\n"
"mènent tous à la page Kate. Les noms Windows ne fonctionnent pas ici -- "
"« notepad »\n"
"ne correspond à aucun nom de page et échoue. Cherchez plutôt par nom Windows "
"dans\n"
"le champ de recherche du manuel ; c'est cet index que désigne « notepad "
"trouve Kate ».\n"
"\n"
"Les pages se trouvent dans /usr/share/dagric/manual et ne nécessitent "
"aucune\n"
"connexion Internet."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:137
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:141
#, sh-format
msgid "No page called \"$ASKED\". Try: dagric-manual --list"
msgstr "Aucune page nommée \"$ASKED\". Essayez : dagric-manual --list"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-manual:195
#, sh-format
msgid "No browser found. The manual is at $ROOT/$PAGE"
msgstr "Aucun navigateur trouvé. Le manuel se trouve dans $ROOT/$PAGE"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:21
msgid "Dagric Migration Assistant"
msgstr "Assistant de migration Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:27
msgid ""
"You are running the LIVE session (from the USB stick).\n"
"\n"
"Anything copied here lands in memory and disappears at shutdown.\n"
"Best order: install Dagric first, then run Migration from the Hub.\n"
"\n"
"Continue anyway (e.g. to rescue a few files)?"
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes dans la session LIVE (depuis la clé USB).\n"
"\n"
"Tout ce qui est copié ici est stocké en mémoire et disparaît à "
"l'extinction.\n"
"Le mieux : installez d'abord Dagric, puis lancez la migration depuis le "
"Hub.\n"
"\n"
"Continuer quand même (par exemple pour sauver quelques fichiers) ?"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:37
msgid "Looking for a Windows installation…"
msgstr "Recherche d'une installation Windows…"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Settings > Privacy & security > Device encryption" is
#. a path through the WINDOWS settings app — use the wording Windows
#. itself uses in your language, because that is what the owner will be
#. reading on the other machine. "BitLocker" is a product name.
#. "Nothing on the drive was changed" is a promise; keep it.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:109
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"A BitLocker-encrypted drive was found ($BITLOCKER) but Dagric cannot\n"
"unlock it without the recovery key.\n"
"\n"
"In Windows: turn off BitLocker (Settings > Privacy & security >\n"
"Device encryption), or copy your files to a plain USB drive instead.\n"
"Nothing on the drive was changed."
msgstr ""
"Un disque chiffré avec BitLocker a été trouvé ($BITLOCKER) mais Dagric ne "
"peut pas\n"
"le déverrouiller sans la clé de récupération.\n"
"\n"
"Sous Windows : désactivez BitLocker (Paramètres > Confidentialité et "
"sécurité >\n"
"Chiffrement de l'appareil), ou copiez plutôt vos fichiers sur une clé USB "
"ordinaire.\n"
"Rien n'a été modifié sur le disque."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:116
msgid ""
"No Windows installation was found on this PC's drives.\n"
"\n"
"If a password prompt appeared and was cancelled, Dagric could not open\n"
"the Windows drive to look inside — run this again and approve it.\n"
"\n"
"If Windows lives on a drive that isn't plugged in, connect it and\n"
"run Migration again from the Dagric Hub. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Aucune installation Windows n'a été trouvée sur les disques de ce PC.\n"
"\n"
"Si une demande de mot de passe est apparue et a été annulée, Dagric n'a pas "
"pu\n"
"ouvrir le disque Windows pour regarder à l'intérieur — relancez ceci et "
"acceptez.\n"
"\n"
"Si Windows se trouve sur un disque non branché, connectez-le et relancez la\n"
"migration depuis le Dagric Hub. Rien n'a été modifié."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:146
#, sh-format
msgid "$dev — $sz of user files"
msgstr "$dev — $sz de fichiers utilisateur"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:149
msgid "Several Windows installations were found. Which one?"
msgstr "Plusieurs installations Windows ont été trouvées. Laquelle ?"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:168
#, sh-format
msgid "No user profiles were found in $WINMNT/Users."
msgstr "Aucun profil utilisateur n'a été trouvé dans $WINMNT/Users."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:181
msgid "Which Windows user are you?"
msgstr "Quel utilisateur Windows êtes-vous ?"

#. TRANSLATORS: "(Files are COPIED — Windows keeps its own untouched.)" is the
#. single most important sentence in this tool. The owner is about to point it
#. at a Windows installation they may still need to boot. It must not read as
#. "moved", and the reassurance must survive.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:200
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Found Windows user \"$WINUSER\". What should come over to Dagric?\n"
"(Files are COPIED — Windows keeps its own untouched.)"
msgstr ""
"Utilisateur Windows « $WINUSER » trouvé. Que faut-il apporter dans Dagric ?\n"
"(Les fichiers sont COPIÉS — Windows garde les siens intacts.)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:202
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Documents"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:203
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Bureau"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:204
msgid "Pictures"
msgstr "Images"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:205
msgid "Music"
msgstr "Musique"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:206
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "Vidéos"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:207
msgid "Downloads"
msgstr "Téléchargements"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:208
msgid "Browser bookmarks (Chrome / Edge / Firefox)"
msgstr "Marque-pages du navigateur (Chrome / Edge / Firefox)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:209
msgid "Browser tabs you had open"
msgstr "Onglets du navigateur que vous aviez ouverts"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:210
msgid "Saved passwords (Firefox only - Chrome explains why)"
msgstr ""
"Mots de passe enregistrés (Firefox uniquement - Chrome explique pourquoi)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:277
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Not enough space: your selection is $NEED_GB GB but this\n"
"disk only has $FREE_GB GB free. Deselect some folders\n"
"(Videos are usually the big one) and try again. Nothing was copied."
msgstr ""
"Espace insuffisant : votre sélection fait $NEED_GB Go mais ce disque\n"
"n'a que $FREE_GB Go de libre. Décochez quelques dossiers (les vidéos\n"
"sont en général les plus volumineuses) et réessayez. Rien n'a été copié."

#. TRANSLATORS: "read-only; Windows is not modified" is the promise the whole
#. tool rests on. It is a statement of fact about what is happening right now —
#. keep it, and keep it in the present tense.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:288
#, sh-format
msgid "=== Dagric Migration: copying from Windows user \"$WINUSER\" ==="
msgstr ""
"=== Migration Dagric : copie depuis l'utilisateur Windows « $WINUSER » ==="

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:289
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"    reading $WINDEV mounted at $WINMNT (read-only; Windows is not modified)"
msgstr ""
"    lecture de $WINDEV monté sur $WINMNT (lecture seule ; Windows n'est pas "
"modifié)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:291
msgid "    (some files could not be read — skipped)"
msgstr "    (certains fichiers n'ont pas pu être lus — ignorés)"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Bookmarks > Manage Bookmarks > Import and Backup >
#. Import Bookmarks from HTML" is a path through FIREFOX's own menus.
#. Use the wording Firefox shows in your language, not a literal
#. translation, or the owner will look for a menu item that is not there.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:428
#, sh-format
msgid "Bookmarks saved to: $OUT"
msgstr "Marque-pages enregistrés dans : $OUT"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:429
msgid ""
"Import them in Firefox:  Bookmarks > Manage Bookmarks >\n"
"Import and Backup > Import Bookmarks from HTML."
msgstr ""
"Pour les importer dans Firefox :  Marque-pages > Gérer les marque-pages >\n"
"Importation et sauvegarde > Importer des marque-pages depuis un fichier HTML."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:443
msgid "--- browser tabs and logins ---"
msgstr "--- onglets et identifiants du navigateur ---"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Primary Password" is Firefox's own term for the
#. master password — use whatever Firefox calls it in your language.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:452
msgid ""
"If this person set a Primary Password in Firefox, type it so the saved\n"
"logins can be unlocked.\n"
"\n"
"Leave it blank if they never set one (most people haven't)."
msgstr ""
"Si cette personne a défini un mot de passe principal dans Firefox, saisissez-"
"le\n"
"pour que les identifiants enregistrés puissent être déverrouillés.\n"
"\n"
"Laissez vide si elle n'en a jamais défini (c'est le cas de la plupart des "
"gens)."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:495
msgid "the browser recovery helper did not finish"
msgstr "l'assistant de récupération du navigateur ne s'est pas terminé"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:498
#, sh-format
msgid "Some browser data could not be read: $MIGFAIL"
msgstr "Certaines données du navigateur n'ont pas pu être lues : $MIGFAIL"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:510
#, sh-format
msgid "Recovered $N_TABS open tab -> ~/Windows-open-tabs.html"
msgid_plural "Recovered $N_TABS open tabs -> ~/Windows-open-tabs.html"
msgstr[0] "$N_TABS onglet ouvert récupéré -> ~/Windows-open-tabs.html"
msgstr[1] "$N_TABS onglets ouverts récupérés -> ~/Windows-open-tabs.html"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:513
msgid ""
"No open tabs could be recovered - the session files could not be read.\n"
"  A half-written session file (an unclean Windows shutdown) can cause this."
msgstr ""
"Aucun onglet ouvert n'a pu être récupéré - les fichiers de session n'ont pas "
"pu\n"
"  être lus. Un fichier de session écrit à moitié (arrêt brutal de Windows) "
"peut\n"
"  en être la cause."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:516
msgid "No open tabs were found (the browsers may have been closed cleanly)."
msgstr ""
"Aucun onglet ouvert n'a été trouvé (les navigateurs ont peut-être été fermés "
"proprement)."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:523
#, sh-format
msgid "Recovered $N_PWDS Firefox login -> ~/Windows-passwords.csv"
msgid_plural "Recovered $N_PWDS Firefox logins -> ~/Windows-passwords.csv"
msgstr[0] "$N_PWDS identifiant Firefox récupéré -> ~/Windows-passwords.csv"
msgstr[1] "$N_PWDS identifiants Firefox récupérés -> ~/Windows-passwords.csv"

#. TRANSLATORS: a plain-text file of the owner's passwords now
#. exists on disk. "Import it, then delete it" is an instruction,
#. and PLAIN TEXT must stay emphatic.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:528
msgid ""
"  This file is PLAIN TEXT and readable only by you.\n"
"  Import it, then delete it."
msgstr ""
"  Ce fichier est en TEXTE CLAIR et n'est lisible que par vous.\n"
"  Importez-le, puis supprimez-le."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:531
msgid "No Firefox logins were recovered."
msgstr "Aucun identifiant Firefox n'a été récupéré."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:538
msgid "Found a password file exported from Chrome:"
msgstr "Un fichier de mots de passe exporté depuis Chrome a été trouvé :"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:540
msgid "  Copy it to your home folder and import it the same way."
msgstr ""
"  Copiez-le dans votre dossier personnel et importez-le de la même façon."

#. TRANSLATORS: the two indented lines are paths through
#. CHROME's and EDGE's settings, on the Windows machine — use
#. the wording those browsers show in your language. The first
#. paragraph explains WHY this cannot work; it is a security
#. property, not an apology, and should not be softened into one.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:548
msgid ""
"Chrome / Edge passwords could NOT be read, and no tool can read them here:\n"
"they are encrypted with a Windows key tied to that Windows account, which\n"
"does not exist on this system. That is a security feature, not a fault.\n"
"\n"
"To bring them over, do this ONCE while still in Windows:\n"
"  Chrome : Settings > Autofill and passwords > Google Password Manager\n"
"           > Settings > Download file\n"
"  Edge   : Settings > Profiles > Passwords > ... > Export passwords\n"
"Save the .csv, then run this migration again - it will pick it up."
msgstr ""
"Les mots de passe de Chrome / Edge n'ont PAS pu être lus, et aucun outil ne "
"peut\n"
"les lire ici : ils sont chiffrés avec une clé Windows liée à ce compte "
"Windows,\n"
"qui n'existe pas sur ce système. C'est une mesure de sécurité, pas un "
"défaut.\n"
"\n"
"Pour les récupérer, faites ceci UNE FOIS pendant que vous êtes encore sous "
"Windows :\n"
"  Chrome : Paramètres > Saisie automatique et mots de passe > Gestionnaire "
"de mots\n"
"           de passe Google > Paramètres > Télécharger le fichier\n"
"  Edge   : Paramètres > Profils > Mots de passe > ... > Exporter les mots de "
"passe\n"
"Enregistrez le .csv, puis relancez cette migration - elle le trouvera."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:563
msgid "=== Migration finished ==="
msgstr "=== Migration terminée ==="

#. TRANSLATORS: the closing promise of the whole tool — "Windows itself was not
#. modified — it was only ever read" is the sentence the owner will remember,
#. and the one that decides whether they trust this product. Do not weaken the
#. negation.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:568
msgid ""
"Done! Your Windows files are now in your Dagric home folder.\n"
"\n"
"Windows itself was not modified — it was only ever read."
msgstr ""
"Terminé ! Vos fichiers Windows sont maintenant dans votre dossier personnel "
"Dagric.\n"
"\n"
"Windows lui-même n'a pas été modifié — il a uniquement été lu."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:604
msgid ""
"• Bookmarks — Bookmarks ▸ Manage Bookmarks ▸ Import and Backup ▸\n"
"  Import Bookmarks from HTML ▸ Windows-bookmarks.html"
msgstr ""
"• Marque-pages — Marque-pages ▸ Gérer les marque-pages ▸ Importation et "
"sauvegarde ▸\n"
"  Importer des marque-pages depuis un fichier HTML ▸ Windows-bookmarks.html"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:609
msgid ""
"• Open tabs — import Windows-open-tabs.html the same way; they arrive as a\n"
"  bookmark folder you can 'Open All in Tabs'"
msgstr ""
"• Onglets ouverts — importez Windows-open-tabs.html de la même façon ; ils "
"arrivent\n"
"  sous forme d'un dossier de marque-pages sur lequel vous pouvez utiliser "
"« Tout ouvrir dans des onglets »"

#. TRANSLATORS: shown only when at least one folder did not copy completely.
#. It sits ABOVE the "Done!" paragraph and has to contradict it, so lead with
#. the negation and keep it first. "Do NOT delete anything from Windows" is
#. the whole point of this block: an owner who believes the copy worked may
#. reclaim the Windows partition next. "Windows itself was still only ever
#. read" keeps the product's central promise intact on the failure path — the
#. copy went wrong, the Windows installation did not.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:622
msgid ""
"⚠ NOT everything was copied.\n"
"\n"
"Some folders did not copy completely — read the messages above, free up "
"disk\n"
"space or check the drive, then run Migration again. Do NOT delete anything\n"
"from Windows until it has finished cleanly.\n"
"\n"
"Windows itself was still only ever read; nothing there was changed."
msgstr ""
"⚠ TOUT n'a PAS été copié.\n"
"\n"
"Certains dossiers n'ont pas été copiés entièrement — lisez les messages\n"
"ci-dessus, libérez de l'espace disque ou vérifiez le disque, puis relancez\n"
"la migration. Ne supprimez RIEN de Windows avant qu'elle ait fini "
"proprement.\n"
"\n"
"Windows lui-même n'a jamais été que lu ; rien n'y a été modifié."

#. TRANSLATORS: a warning that a plain-text password file is sitting in the
#. owner's home folder. "Delete it once imported" must survive translation.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:640
msgid ""
"• Passwords — Firefox ▸ Passwords ▸ ⋯ ▸ Import from a File ▸\n"
"  Windows-passwords.csv   (KeePassXC on Pro can import the same file)\n"
"\n"
"⚠ Windows-passwords.csv is PLAIN TEXT. Delete it once imported."
msgstr ""
"• Mots de passe — Firefox ▸ Mots de passe ▸ ⋯ ▸ Importer depuis un fichier "
"▸\n"
"  Windows-passwords.csv   (KeePassXC sur Pro peut importer le même fichier)\n"
"\n"
"⚠ Windows-passwords.csv est en TEXTE CLAIR. Supprimez-le une fois importé."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-migrate:651
msgid "To finish up, in Firefox:"
msgstr "Pour finir, dans Firefox :"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:9
msgid "Dagric Security Checkup"
msgstr "Contrôle de sécurité Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:12
msgid "Running a security audit — about a minute…"
msgstr "Audit de sécurité en cours — environ une minute…"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:32
msgid "The audit could not run (it needs administrator access)."
msgstr "L'audit n'a pas pu s'exécuter (il nécessite un accès administrateur)."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is a HARDWARE FAILURE warning. The owner's disk is
#. dying and their files are at risk. Keep the urgency — "back up now"
#. is an instruction, not a suggestion.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:44
msgid "Drive health:  ⚠ A DRIVE IS FAILING — back up now!"
msgstr ""
"État des disques :  ⚠ UN DISQUE EST DÉFAILLANT — sauvegardez maintenant !"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Kup" is the name of the backup app that ships with
#. Dagric — do not translate it.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:50
msgid "A disk is reporting SMART failure — it may die soon."
msgstr "Un disque signale une défaillance SMART — il peut lâcher bientôt."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:54
msgid ""
"Back up your files NOW (Kup is preinstalled), and plan to\n"
"replace the drive."
msgstr ""
"Sauvegardez vos fichiers MAINTENANT (Kup est préinstallé) et prévoyez\n"
"de remplacer le disque."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is a "we could not tell" result — neither a pass nor
#. a failure. Keep both halves of the sentence.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:66
msgid "Drive health:  no failures reported, but some drives could not be read"
msgstr ""
"État des disques :  aucune panne signalée, mais certains disques n'ont pas "
"pu être lus"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:70
msgid "Drive health:  all drives report healthy (SMART)"
msgstr "État des disques :  tous les disques se déclarent sains (SMART)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:76
msgid "see report"
msgstr "voir le rapport"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:90
#, sh-format
msgid "Hardening index:  $SCORE / 100"
msgstr "Indice de durcissement :  $SCORE / 100"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:91
msgid ""
"Dagric ships hardened by default — AppArmor confinement, a hardened kernel,\n"
"a firewall, and silent security updates are all on before you change a "
"thing.\n"
"Plasma also watches your drives' SMART health and warns you if one degrades."
msgstr ""
"Dagric est durci par défaut — confinement AppArmor, noyau durci, pare-feu et "
"mises\n"
"à jour de sécurité silencieuses sont actifs avant même que vous ne changiez "
"quoi que\n"
"ce soit. Plasma surveille aussi l'état SMART de vos disques et vous avertit "
"si l'un\n"
"d'eux se dégrade."

#. TRANSLATORS: "sudo lynis show details" is a command typed verbatim, and
#. /var/log/lynis.log is a file path. Neither is translated.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-security-checkup:96
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Warnings flagged:  $WARN\n"
"Full report:  /var/log/lynis.log\n"
"For details, run  sudo lynis show details  in a terminal."
msgstr ""
"Avertissements signalés :  $WARN\n"
"Rapport complet :  /var/log/lynis.log\n"
"Pour le détail, lancez  sudo lynis show details  dans un terminal."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:18
msgid "HP support installed. Add your printer in System Settings > Printers."
msgstr ""
"Prise en charge HP installée. Ajoutez votre imprimante dans Configuration du "
"système > Imprimantes."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:24
msgid ""
"HP support could NOT be installed — see the messages above. Check your "
"internet connection and try again from the Hub."
msgstr ""
"La prise en charge HP n'a PAS pu être installée — voyez les messages ci-"
"dessus. Vérifiez votre connexion internet et réessayez depuis le Hub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:28
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:49
msgid "Finish setting up Dagric"
msgstr "Terminer la configuration de Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:30
msgid "Pick what to set up — run this again anytime from the Hub:"
msgstr ""
"Choisissez ce qu'il faut configurer — vous pouvez relancer ceci à tout "
"moment depuis le Hub :"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:31
msgid "NVIDIA graphics driver"
msgstr "Pilote graphique NVIDIA"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:32
msgid "HP printer and scanner support"
msgstr "Prise en charge des imprimantes et scanners HP"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:33
msgid "Enable Flathub in Discover"
msgstr "Activer Flathub dans Discover"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:50
msgid ""
"You are running the live trial from the USB stick.\n"
"\n"
"Anything installed now is kept in this computer's memory rather than on a "
"disk:\n"
"it disappears at shutdown, and on a machine without much RAM it can make "
"the\n"
"trial session unstable. Installing Dagric first avoids both.\n"
"\n"
"Continue anyway?"
msgstr ""
"Vous utilisez l'essai live depuis la clé USB.\n"
"\n"
"Tout ce qui est installé maintenant reste en mémoire, pas sur un disque :\n"
"cela disparaît à l'extinction et, sur une machine qui a peu de RAM, cela "
"peut\n"
"rendre la session d'essai instable. Installer d'abord Dagric évite les "
"deux.\n"
"\n"
"Continuer quand même ?"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:115
msgid "Flathub enabled — browse apps in Discover."
msgstr "Flathub est activé — parcourez les applications dans Discover."

#. TRANSLATORS: shown when enabling Flathub did not work. It
#. names BOTH causes on purpose — this cannot tell a network
#. failure from a cancelled password prompt, so it must not
#. diagnose one of them and send the owner off to fix the wrong
#. thing.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:123
msgid ""
"Flathub could NOT be enabled — you may be offline, or the password prompt "
"was cancelled. Try again anytime from the Hub."
msgstr ""
"Flathub n'a PAS pu être activé — vous êtes peut-être hors ligne, ou la "
"demande de mot de passe a été annulée. Vous pouvez réessayer à tout moment "
"depuis le Hub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:110
msgid ""
"No styles are installed. Reinstall the dagric-branding package to restore "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Aucun style n'est installé. Réinstallez le paquet dagric-branding pour les "
"restaurer."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:131
msgid "Accent color — pick any color"
msgstr "Couleur d'accentuation — choisissez n'importe quelle couleur"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:132
msgid "Reset — standard Dagric look"
msgstr "Réinitialiser — l'apparence Dagric standard"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:135
msgid "Pick a mood — colors, wallpaper, effects. Panels stay put:"
msgstr ""
"Choisissez une ambiance — couleurs, fond d'écran, effets. Les panneaux ne "
"bougent pas :"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:155
msgid "accent color"
msgstr "couleur d'accentuation"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:162
#, sh-format
msgid "Accent color set to $HEX"
msgstr "Couleur d'accentuation réglée sur $HEX"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:185
msgid ""
"The standard Dagric style is missing, so nothing was changed. Reinstall the "
"dagric-branding package to restore it."
msgstr ""
"Le style Dagric standard est absent, rien n'a donc été modifié. Réinstallez "
"le paquet dagric-branding pour le restaurer."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:189
msgid "Reset to the standard Dagric look"
msgstr "Réinitialiser l'apparence Dagric standard"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-style:201
#, sh-format
msgid "Style applied: $NAME"
msgstr "Style appliqué : $NAME"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:64
msgid "STOPPED:"
msgstr "ARRÊTÉ :"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:73
msgid "run this as root:  sudo dagric-upgrade-to-pro"
msgstr "exécutez ceci en tant que root :  sudo dagric-upgrade-to-pro"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:78
msgid "Dagric OS — upgrade this machine to Pro"
msgstr "Dagric OS — passer cette machine à Pro"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:86
msgid "This machine is already running Dagric OS Pro."
msgstr "Cette machine exécute déjà Dagric OS Pro."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:87
msgid "Nothing to do."
msgstr "Rien à faire."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:97
msgid "This is the live USB session, not an installed system."
msgstr "Ceci est la session USB live, pas un système installé."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:99
msgid "An upgrade here would be written to memory and lost at shutdown."
msgstr "Une mise à niveau ici serait écrite en mémoire et perdue à l'arrêt."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:100
msgid "Install Dagric first, then run this on the installed machine."
msgstr "Installez d'abord Dagric, puis exécutez ceci sur la machine installée."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:122
msgid "ERROR: some packages on this machine are half-configured."
msgstr "ERREUR : certains paquets sur cette machine sont à moitié configurés."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:126
msgid "Run  sudo dpkg --configure -a  first, then try again."
msgstr "Exécutez d'abord  sudo dpkg --configure -a , puis réessayez."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:141
msgid "ERROR: not enough free disk space."
msgstr "ERREUR : espace disque libre insuffisant."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:142
#, sh-format
msgid "Pro needs about 6 GB free; this machine has $FREE_GB GB."
msgstr ""
"Pro nécessite environ 6 Go libres ; cette machine dispose de $FREE_GB Go."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:150
msgid "ERROR: this machine is running on battery."
msgstr "ERREUR : cette machine fonctionne sur batterie."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:151
msgid "Plug it in first — this installs several gigabytes."
msgstr "Branchez-la d'abord — cela installe plusieurs gigaoctets."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:155
msgid "ERROR: curl is missing."
msgstr "ERREUR : curl est manquant."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:157
msgid "fix the above and run this again. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "corrigez ce qui précède et réexécutez ceci. Rien n'a été modifié."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:159
#, sh-format
msgid "This machine: Dagric OS $CUR"
msgstr "Cette machine : Dagric OS $CUR"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:160
#, sh-format
msgid "Free disk:    $FREE_GB GB"
msgstr "Espace libre :    $FREE_GB Go"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:166
msgid "Your Pro purchase"
msgstr "Votre achat Pro"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:169
msgid "Open the download page from your purchase email. Its address ends in"
msgstr ""
"Ouvrez la page de téléchargement depuis votre e-mail d'achat. Son adresse se "
"termine par"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:171
msgid "Paste that cs_... value here (it is not a password and not secret)."
msgstr ""
"Collez cette valeur cs_... ici (ce n'est pas un mot de passe et ce n'est pas "
"secret)."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:176
msgid "Purchase session: "
msgstr "Session d'achat : "

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:184
msgid ""
"that does not look like a purchase session. It starts with cs_ and\n"
"        appears in the address of your download page. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"cela ne ressemble pas à une session d'achat. Elle commence par cs_ et\n"
"        apparaît dans l'adresse de votre page de téléchargement. Rien n'a "
"été modifié."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:189
msgid "Checking the purchase..."
msgstr "Vérification de l'achat..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:210
msgid "Confirmed. Thank you."
msgstr "Confirmé. Merci."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:212
msgid ""
"that purchase session was not recognised as paid. If you have just\n"
"        bought Pro, give it a minute and try again — and if it keeps "
"failing,\n"
"        dagric.com/support can look it up. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"cette session d'achat n'a pas été reconnue comme payée. Si vous venez\n"
"        d'acheter Pro, attendez une minute et réessayez — et si cela échoue "
"toujours,\n"
"        dagric.com/support pourra la rechercher. Rien n'a été modifié."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:220
msgid ""
"that session code looks incomplete. Copy the whole cs_... value\n"
"        from the address bar of your download page — it is long, and it is "
"easy\n"
"        to miss the end of it. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"ce code de session semble incomplet. Copiez toute la valeur cs_...\n"
"        depuis la barre d'adresse de votre page de téléchargement — elle est "
"longue, et il est facile\n"
"        d'en manquer la fin. Rien n'a été modifié."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:224
msgid ""
"could not reach the licence check just now. Your purchase is fine;\n"
"        this is our end or your connection. Try again in a minute. Nothing "
"was\n"
"        changed."
msgstr ""
"la vérification de licence est temporairement inaccessible. Votre achat est "
"valide ;\n"
"        le problème vient de notre côté ou de votre connexion. Réessayez "
"dans une minute. Rien n'a été\n"
"        modifié."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:231
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"the licence check answered $HTTP, which it should not. Please send\n"
"        that number to dagric.com/support. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"la vérification de licence a répondu $HTTP, ce qui ne devrait pas arriver. "
"Veuillez envoyer\n"
"        ce numéro à dagric.com/support. Rien n'a été modifié."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:237
msgid "--check: the purchase is valid and this machine can be upgraded."
msgstr "--check : l'achat est valide et cette machine peut être mise à niveau."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:238
msgid "Run without --check to do it."
msgstr "Exécutez sans --check pour le faire."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:255
msgid "What this will do"
msgstr "Ce qui va se passer"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:258
msgid ""
"  * install the Pro applications — the creator suite, the gaming stack, the\n"
"    virtualisation tools, the backup tools and the rest (about 83 packages)"
msgstr ""
"  * installer les applications Pro — la suite créateur, la pile de jeu, les\n"
"    outils de virtualisation, les outils de sauvegarde et le reste (environ "
"83 paquets)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:260
msgid ""
"  * install them the way the Pro ISO does: Docker, virtual machines, USB\n"
"    protection and remote login are all set up but left OFF until you "
"switch\n"
"    them on. The one exception is OpenSnitch, the application firewall, "
"which\n"
"    is switched ON — the same as the Pro ISO, because a firewall nobody "
"turned\n"
"    on protects nobody. It blocks nothing on its own; it asks you the first\n"
"    time a program reaches the internet. Dagric's own background services —\n"
"    the clock, updates, printing, the software centre — are answered for "
"you\n"
"    in advance, so the questions you get are about programs you chose."
msgstr ""
"  * installez-les comme le fait l'ISO Pro : Docker, les machines virtuelles, "
"la protection USB\n"
"    et la connexion à distance sont tous configurés mais laissés DÉSACTIVÉS "
"jusqu'à ce que vous les\n"
"    activiez. La seule exception est OpenSnitch, le pare-feu d'applications, "
"qui est\n"
"    ACTIVÉ — comme sur l'ISO Pro, car un pare-feu que personne n'a activé ne "
"protège\n"
"    personne. Il ne bloque rien de lui-même ; il vous demande la première "
"fois\n"
"    qu'un programme accède à Internet. Les services d'arrière-plan propres à "
"Dagric —\n"
"    l'horloge, les mises à jour, l'impression, le centre logiciel — sont "
"répondus pour vous\n"
"    à l'avance, donc les questions que vous recevez concernent les "
"programmes que vous avez choisis."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:268
msgid "  * add the four extra desktop layouts and three extra colour styles"
msgstr ""
"  * ajouter les quatre mises en page de bureau supplémentaires et trois "
"styles de couleurs supplémentaires"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:269
msgid ""
"  * mark this machine as Pro, so the Hub and the appearance gallery show\n"
"    everything you have paid for"
msgstr ""
"  * marquer cette machine comme Pro, afin que le Hub et la galerie "
"d'apparence affichent\n"
"    tout ce que vous avez payé"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:272
msgid ""
"Your files, your settings, your installed applications and your wallpaper "
"are\n"
"not touched."
msgstr ""
"Vos fichiers, vos paramètres, vos applications installées et votre fond "
"d'écran ne sont\n"
"pas touchés."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:275
msgid ""
"This downloads several gigabytes and takes a while on a slow connection."
msgstr ""
"Cela télécharge plusieurs gigaoctets et prend du temps sur une connexion "
"lente."

#. TRANSLATORS: a word the owner must TYPE EXACTLY to confirm. Short, UPPERCASE,
#. one word, no spaces. Use ASCII LETTERS ONLY — no accents, no umlauts, no
#. cedillas: this is typed at a bare terminal prompt on whatever keyboard layout
#. the machine happens to have, and a character the owner cannot produce turns a
#. speed bump into a wall. Write it the way your language transliterates into
#. ASCII (German ue for u-umlaut, and so on). Make it a word your language
#. actually uses for "upgrade" — a speed bump nobody can read is also a wall.
#. The English UPGRADE keeps working whatever you put here.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:300
msgid "UPGRADE"
msgstr "MAJ"

#. TRANSLATORS: as above, ASCII letters only. Deliberately a DIFFERENT word from
#. the one above, because it is a different and more serious decision — typing
#. the same thing for both would make them feel like one.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:304
msgid "NO-ROLLBACK"
msgstr "SANSRETOUR"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:307
msgid "A snapshot is taken first, so this is recoverable from the boot menu."
msgstr ""
"Un instantané est pris d'abord, donc cela est récupérable depuis le menu de "
"démarrage."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:309
#, sh-format
msgid "Type $UPGRADE_WORD to continue: "
msgstr "Tapez $UPGRADE_WORD pour continuer : "

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:318
msgid "THIS MACHINE HAS NO ROLLBACK."
msgstr "CETTE MACHINE N'A AUCUN RETOUR EN ARRIÈRE."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:326
msgid ""
"Snapshots need a btrfs root and this install does not have one. Nothing "
"here\n"
"deletes your files, and the worst realistic outcome is a half-installed set "
"of\n"
"applications you can finish with  sudo apt-get -f install  — but there is "
"no\n"
"one-click way back."
msgstr ""
"Les instantanés nécessitent une racine btrfs et cette installation n'en a "
"pas. Rien ici\n"
"ne supprime vos fichiers, et le pire résultat réaliste est un ensemble "
"d'applications à moitié\n"
"installé que vous pouvez terminer avec  sudo apt-get -f install  — mais il "
"n'y a aucun\n"
"moyen simple de revenir en arrière."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:331
#, sh-format
msgid "Type $NOROLLBACK_WORD to continue anyway, or press Enter to stop: "
msgstr ""
"Tapez $NOROLLBACK_WORD pour continuer quand même, ou appuyez sur Entrée pour "
"arrêter : "

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:334
msgid "Nothing changed. That was the safe answer."
msgstr "Rien n'a été modifié. C'était la réponse sûre."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:342
msgid "Taking a rollback snapshot..."
msgstr "Prise d'un instantané de restauration..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:348
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:387
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:485
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:573
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:604
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:656
msgid "done."
msgstr "terminé."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:350
msgid ""
"the snapshot failed, so this stopped before changing anything.\n"
"        That is deliberate: the rollback was the reason it was safe to "
"proceed."
msgstr ""
"l'instantané a échoué, donc cela s'est arrêté avant de modifier quoi que ce "
"soit.\n"
"        C'est délibéré : la restauration était la raison pour laquelle il "
"était sûr de continuer."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:359
msgid "cannot create a working directory."
msgstr "impossible de créer un répertoire de travail."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:364
msgid "Fetching the Pro layouts and styles..."
msgstr "Récupération des mises en page et styles Pro..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:392
msgid "that attempt did not work; trying again in a few seconds..."
msgstr ""
"cette tentative n'a pas fonctionné ; nouvel essai dans quelques secondes..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:399
msgid ""
"the extra desktop layouts and colour styles could not be downloaded,\n"
"        and they are the one part of Pro that has to come from us rather "
"than\n"
"        from Debian. NOTHING has been installed and nothing on this machine "
"has\n"
"        been changed, so there is nothing half-finished to clean up. Your\n"
"        purchase is fine. Run this again when the connection is steady — and "
"if\n"
"        it keeps failing, dagric.com/support can look it up."
msgstr ""
"les mises en page de bureau et styles de couleurs supplémentaires n'ont pas "
"pu être téléchargés,\n"
"        et ils sont la seule partie de Pro qui doit venir de nous plutôt "
"que\n"
"        de Debian. RIEN n'a été installé et rien sur cette machine n'a\n"
"        été modifié, donc il n'y a rien de à moitié terminé à nettoyer. "
"Votre\n"
"        achat est valide. Réexécutez ceci lorsque la connexion est stable — "
"et si\n"
"        cela échoue toujours, dagric.com/support pourra le rechercher."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:428
msgid "Reading package lists..."
msgstr "Lecture des listes de paquets..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:430
msgid ""
"could not read the package lists. Check the network and try again.\n"
"    Nothing was installed."
msgstr ""
"impossible de lire les listes de paquets. Vérifiez le réseau et réessayez.\n"
"    Rien n'a été installé."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:436
msgid "Downloading (this is the long part)..."
msgstr "Téléchargement (c'est la partie longue)..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:439
msgid ""
"the download did not finish, so nothing was installed. This is usually\n"
"    the connection. Run this again — apt keeps what it already fetched."
msgstr ""
"le téléchargement ne s'est pas terminé, donc rien n'a été installé. C'est "
"généralement\n"
"    la connexion. Réexécutez ceci — apt conserve ce qu'il a déjà téléchargé."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:442
msgid "Installing..."
msgstr "Installation..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:481
msgid "Adding 32-bit support for Windows applications and games..."
msgstr "Ajout du support 32 bits pour les applications et jeux Windows..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:487
msgid ""
"note: 32-bit Wine and Vulkan did not install. Wine still works\n"
"        for 64-bit Windows programs; older installers may not run."
msgstr ""
"note : Wine et Vulkan 32 bits ne se sont pas installés. Wine fonctionne "
"toujours\n"
"        pour les programmes Windows 64 bits ; les anciens installateurs "
"peuvent ne pas fonctionner."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:491
msgid ""
"note: could not enable 32-bit support. Wine still works for 64-bit\n"
"        Windows programs; older installers may not run."
msgstr ""
"note : impossible d'activer le support 32 bits. Wine fonctionne toujours "
"pour les programmes\n"
"        Windows 64 bits ; les anciens installateurs peuvent ne pas "
"fonctionner."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:502
msgid ""
"Setting the opt-in policy (everything installed, nothing switched on)..."
msgstr ""
"Configuration de la politique d'activation (tout est installé, rien n'est "
"activé)..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:564
msgid ""
"note: could not open the KDE Connect ports. Phone pairing may need\n"
"        the firewall adjusting by hand; everything else is unaffected."
msgstr ""
"note : impossible d'ouvrir les ports KDE Connect. L'appairage du téléphone "
"peut nécessiter\n"
"        un ajustement manuel du pare-feu ; tout le reste n'est pas affecté."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:579
msgid "ERROR: the install did not finish cleanly."
msgstr "ERREUR : l'installation ne s'est pas terminée proprement."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:581
msgid ""
"This machine is still marked as free ON PURPOSE — one that claims to be\n"
"Pro without the applications is harder to fix than one that is honestly\n"
"still free."
msgstr ""
"Cette machine est toujours marquée comme gratuite VOLONTAIREMENT — une "
"machine qui prétend être\n"
"Pro sans les applications est plus difficile à réparer qu'une machine qui "
"est honnêtement\n"
"encore gratuite."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:585
msgid ""
"Whatever DID install has been set to the Pro edition's opt-in policy, so\n"
"nothing that arrived is running: no Docker daemon, no remote login, no\n"
"USB blocking, no virtual-machine services."
msgstr ""
"Tout ce qui s'est installé a été configuré selon la politique d'activation "
"de l'édition Pro, donc\n"
"rien de ce qui est arrivé ne fonctionne : pas de démon Docker, pas de "
"connexion à distance, pas de\n"
"blocage USB, pas de services de machines virtuelles."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:589
msgid "Try:  sudo apt-get -f install   then run this again."
msgstr "Essayez :  sudo apt-get -f install   puis réexécutez ceci."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:596
msgid "Adding the Pro layouts and styles..."
msgstr "Ajout des mises en page et styles Pro..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:611
msgid ""
"the layouts and styles arrived but would not unpack — usually that\n"
"        is disk space. The applications ARE installed and set to the Pro opt-"
"in\n"
"        policy, but this machine has deliberately not been marked as Pro "
"yet, so\n"
"        running this tool again will finish the job."
msgstr ""
"les mises en page et styles sont arrivés mais n'ont pas pu être décompressés "
"— c'est généralement\n"
"        une question d'espace disque. Les applications SONT installées et "
"configurées selon la politique\n"
"        d'activation Pro, mais cette machine n'a volontairement pas encore "
"été marquée comme Pro, donc\n"
"        réexécuter cet outil terminera le travail."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:624
msgid "Marking this machine as Pro..."
msgstr "Marquage de cette machine comme Pro..."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:664
msgid "Done — this is a Dagric OS Pro machine."
msgstr "Terminé — c'est une machine Dagric OS Pro."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:666
msgid ""
"Log out and back in to see it. The Hub will show the Pro tools, and the\n"
"  appearance gallery will show the extra layouts and styles."
msgstr ""
"Déconnectez-vous puis reconnectez-vous pour le voir. Le Hub affichera les "
"outils Pro, et la\n"
"  galerie d'apparence affichera les mises en page et styles supplémentaires."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:669
msgid ""
"Everything the Pro edition installs is here, and everything that can listen "
"or\n"
"intercept is OFF until you turn it on:"
msgstr ""
"Tout ce que l'édition Pro installe est ici, et tout ce qui peut écouter ou\n"
"intercepter est DÉSACTIVÉ jusqu'à ce que vous l'activiez :"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:672
msgid "Docker, virtual machines, USB protection and remote login"
msgstr "Docker, machines virtuelles, protection USB et connexion à distance"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:672
msgid "installed, off"
msgstr "installé, désactivé"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:673
msgid "OpenSnitch application firewall"
msgstr "Pare-feu applicatif OpenSnitch"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:673
msgid "installed, on"
msgstr "installé, activé"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:675
msgid "Turn any of them on from the Dagric Hub."
msgstr "Activez-les depuis le Dagric Hub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:677
msgid "Two honest differences from a machine installed from the Pro ISO:"
msgstr ""
"Deux différences honnêtes par rapport à une machine installée depuis l'ISO "
"Pro :"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:679
msgid ""
"  * The Pro ISO ships CJK fonts and a few defaults chosen at install time. "
"Those\n"
"    are here too, but your existing settings were kept rather than replaced "
"—\n"
"    which is the point of upgrading rather than reinstalling."
msgstr ""
"  * L'ISO Pro inclut les polices CJK et quelques réglages par défaut choisis "
"à l'installation. Ceux-ci\n"
"    sont aussi présents, mais vos paramètres existants ont été conservés "
"plutôt que remplacés —\n"
"    c'est le but de la mise à niveau plutôt que de la réinstallation."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:682
msgid ""
"  * Your snapshot history starts before this upgrade, not at a fresh install."
msgstr ""
"  * Votre historique d'instantanés commence avant cette mise à niveau, pas à "
"une installation fraîche."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-upgrade-to-pro:684
msgid "Thank you for buying Pro."
msgstr "Merci d'avoir acheté Pro."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:31
msgid "Dagric USB Protection"
msgstr "Protection USB Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:35
msgid "USB protection is a Dagric Pro feature."
msgstr "La protection USB est une fonctionnalité de Dagric Pro."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:52
msgid ""
"USB protection can only be set up on an installed Dagric system.\n"
"\n"
"This is the live trial running from the USB stick: the allow-list would be "
"kept\n"
"in memory and lost at shutdown, and any USB drive you plug in before then "
"would\n"
"be blocked. Install Dagric first, then turn this on from the Dagric Hub."
msgstr ""
"La protection USB ne peut être configurée que sur un système Dagric "
"installé.\n"
"\n"
"Ceci est l'essai live lancé depuis la clé USB : la liste d'autorisation "
"serait\n"
"gardée en mémoire et perdue à l'extinction, et toute clé USB branchée d'ici "
"là\n"
"serait bloquée. Installez d'abord Dagric, puis activez-la depuis le Dagric "
"Hub."

#. TRANSLATORS: the owner dismissed the password prompt, or it failed.
#. Keep "still ON" — the whole point of this tool is that the owner
#. always knows whether the machine is protected.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:131
msgid ""
"Nothing was added — USB protection is still ON and everything you\n"
"already allowed keeps working.\n"
"\n"
"(Adding a device needs administrator access.)"
msgstr ""
"Aucun appareil n’a été ajouté — la protection USB est toujours ACTIVÉE et "
"tout ce\n"
"que vous avez déjà autorisé continue de fonctionner.\n"
"\n"
"(L’ajout d’un appareil nécessite un accès administrateur.)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:145
msgid ""
"USB protection is no longer running.\n"
"\n"
"The USB protection service has stopped, so unknown USB devices are\n"
"NOT being blocked at the moment. Restart this computer, then open\n"
"USB protection from the Dagric Hub to switch it back on."
msgstr ""
"La protection USB n’est plus en cours d’exécution.\n"
"\n"
"Le service de protection USB s’est arrêté, les appareils USB inconnus ne "
"sont\n"
"donc PAS bloqués pour le moment. Redémarrez cet ordinateur, puis ouvrez\n"
"la protection USB depuis le Dagric Hub pour la réactiver."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:164
msgid ""
"Nothing is being blocked right now.\n"
"\n"
"Every USB device plugged into this computer is already allowed, so\n"
"there was nothing to add. If something still does not work, USB\n"
"protection is not what is stopping it.\n"
"\n"
"Protection is still ON."
msgstr ""
"Rien n’est bloqué pour le moment.\n"
"\n"
"Tous les appareils USB branchés sur cet ordinateur sont déjà autorisés, il "
"n’y avait\n"
"donc rien à ajouter. Si quelque chose ne fonctionne toujours pas, la "
"protection USB\n"
"n’est pas ce qui le bloque.\n"
"\n"
"La protection est toujours ACTIVÉE."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:174
msgid ""
"Your new device is allowed now.\n"
"\n"
"The USB devices that were being blocked have been added to the\n"
"allow-list, and they stay allowed after you restart.\n"
"\n"
"USB protection is still ON — devices you have not approved are\n"
"still blocked."
msgstr ""
"Votre nouvel appareil est maintenant autorisé.\n"
"\n"
"Les appareils USB qui étaient bloqués ont été ajoutés à la liste "
"d’autorisation,\n"
"et ils restent autorisés après le redémarrage.\n"
"\n"
"La protection USB est toujours ACTIVÉE — les appareils que vous n’avez pas "
"approuvés\n"
"sont toujours bloqués."

#. TRANSLATORS:`
#. only carries a comment block that STARTS with the tag, so a note appended
#. to the end of a block like this one never reaches the .pot at all and the
#. translator never sees it. Hence the split.
#. TRANSLATORS: "nothing that already worked has changed" is literally true —
#. this path only ever ADDS allow rules — and it is the sentence that stops a
#. worried owner from switching protection off to be safe. Keep it.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:197
msgid ""
"Some USB devices are still blocked.\n"
"\n"
"Dagric could not add all of them. Nothing that already worked has\n"
"changed, and USB protection is still ON.\n"
"\n"
"If your new device still does not appear, unplug it, plug it back\n"
"in, and run this again."
msgstr ""
"Certains appareils USB sont toujours bloqués.\n"
"\n"
"Dagric n’a pas pu tous les ajouter. Rien de ce qui fonctionnait déjà n’a été "
"modifié,\n"
"et la protection USB est toujours ACTIVÉE.\n"
"\n"
"Si votre nouvel appareil n’apparaît toujours pas, débranchez-le, rebranchez-"
"le,\n"
"et relancez cette opération."

#. TRANSLATORS: three buttons, and the body text names two of them in
#. typographic quotes — “Allow my new device” and “Turn protection off”.
#. Those two labels are separate messages immediately below this one;
#. translate them the SAME way in both places or the dialog tells the owner
#. to press a button that is not there. The warning to unplug anything
#. unrecognised is a real one, not filler: this path allow-lists whatever is
#. attached, exactly as the switch-on dialog does.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:232
msgid "Allow my new device"
msgstr "Autoriser mon nouvel appareil"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:233
msgid "Turn protection off"
msgstr "Désactiver la protection"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:234
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Annuler"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:236
msgid ""
"USB protection is currently ON — unknown USB devices are blocked.\n"
"\n"
"Plugged something in and it does not appear? Leave it plugged in\n"
"and choose “Allow my new device”. Everything plugged in and blocked\n"
"right now is added to the allow-list for good, so unplug anything\n"
"you do not recognise first. Protection stays ON and nothing that\n"
"already works is taken away.\n"
"\n"
"“Turn protection off” allows every USB device again, including ones\n"
"you have never seen."
msgstr ""
"La protection USB est actuellement ACTIVÉE — les appareils USB inconnus sont "
"bloqués.\n"
"\n"
"Vous avez branché un appareil et il n’apparaît pas ? Laissez-le branché et\n"
"choisissez “Autoriser mon nouvel appareil”. Tout ce qui est branché et "
"bloqué\n"
"en ce moment est ajouté définitivement à la liste d’autorisation, débranchez "
"donc\n"
"d’abord tout ce que vous ne reconnaissez pas. La protection reste ACTIVÉE et "
"rien\n"
"de ce qui fonctionne déjà n’est retiré.\n"
"\n"
"“Désactiver la protection” autorise à nouveau tous les appareils USB, y "
"compris ceux\n"
"que vous n’avez jamais vus."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:263
msgid "USB protection is off. All USB devices work normally."
msgstr ""
"La protection USB est désactivée. Tous les périphériques USB fonctionnent "
"normalement."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:266
msgid "Could not turn it off (administrator access is required)."
msgstr "Impossible de la désactiver (un accès administrateur est nécessaire)."

#. TRANSLATORS: the most consequential dialog in the product. "plug in
#. everything you normally use before continuing" is a WARNING, not advice —
#. a device that is unplugged now really is blocked when it comes back, and
#. that can include the owner's keyboard. Do not soften it, and do not drop
#. the reassurance that this can be re-run or turned off.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:277
msgid ""
"Turn ON USB protection?\n"
"\n"
"Dagric will remember every USB device plugged in RIGHT NOW — your\n"
"keyboard, mouse, webcam, printer, drives — and allow those. Any\n"
"OTHER USB device plugged in later is blocked until you approve it.\n"
"\n"
"IMPORTANT: plug in everything you normally use before continuing.\n"
"Anything unplugged now will be blocked when you plug it back in\n"
"(you can always re-run this to refresh the list, or turn it off).\n"
"\n"
"Protects against malicious USB devices that pretend to be keyboards."
msgstr ""
"Activer la protection USB ?\n"
"\n"
"Dagric va mémoriser tous les périphériques USB branchés EN CE MOMENT — "
"votre\n"
"clavier, souris, webcam, imprimante, disques — et les autoriser. Tout AUTRE\n"
"périphérique USB branché par la suite sera bloqué jusqu'à ce que vous "
"l'approuviez.\n"
"\n"
"IMPORTANT : branchez tout ce que vous utilisez habituellement avant de "
"continuer.\n"
"Ce qui est débranché maintenant sera bloqué quand vous le rebrancherez "
"(vous\n"
"pouvez toujours relancer ceci pour actualiser la liste, ou la désactiver).\n"
"\n"
"Protège contre les périphériques USB malveillants qui se font passer pour "
"des claviers."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:329
msgid ""
"USB protection is ON.\n"
"\n"
"Everything currently plugged in is allowed. New USB devices are\n"
"blocked until you approve them — re-run this tool any time to\n"
"refresh the list or turn protection back off."
msgstr ""
"La protection USB est ACTIVÉE.\n"
"\n"
"Tout ce qui est actuellement branché est autorisé. Les nouveaux "
"périphériques USB\n"
"sont bloqués jusqu'à ce que vous les approuviez — relancez cet outil à tout "
"moment\n"
"pour actualiser la liste ou désactiver la protection."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is the reassuring failure case — nothing was changed
#. and every USB device still works. Keep "nothing was changed" explicit.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-usb-protect:338
msgid ""
"USB protection was NOT enabled — nothing was changed, and all your\n"
"USB devices keep working.\n"
"\n"
"(This needs administrator access, and Dagric deliberately refuses to\n"
"arm USB blocking without a device allow-list.)"
msgstr ""
"La protection USB n'a PAS été activée — rien n'a été modifié et tous vos\n"
"périphériques USB continuent de fonctionner.\n"
"\n"
"(Cela nécessite un accès administrateur, et Dagric refuse délibérément "
"d'armer\n"
"le blocage USB sans liste d'autorisation des périphériques.)"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:34
msgid ""
"Windows in a virtual machine is a Dagric Pro feature — the KVM/QEMU\n"
"stack and Virtual Machine Manager are not installed on this edition.\n"
"Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Windows dans une machine virtuelle est une fonctionnalité de Dagric Pro — "
"la\n"
"pile KVM/QEMU et le Gestionnaire de machines virtuelles ne sont pas "
"installés\n"
"sur cette édition. Rien n'a été modifié."

#. TRANSLATORS: 'libvirt' and 'kvm' are Linux group names typed verbatim —
#. never translate them. KVM, QEMU and "Virtual Machine Manager" are product
#. names; use the name the app shows in your language for the last one only if
#. it really is translated there.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:44
msgid ""
"Dagric — Windows in a window (virtual machines)\n"
"\n"
"Pro ships a complete, open-source VM stack: KVM (the Linux kernel's own\n"
"hypervisor), QEMU, and the Virtual Machine Manager app. A virtual machine\n"
"runs a whole other OS — including real Windows — inside a window, safely\n"
"walled off from your files.\n"
"\n"
"This setup will:\n"
"  1. check that your CPU's virtualization is enabled,\n"
"  2. add your user to the 'libvirt' and 'kvm' groups (needs your password),\n"
"  3. make sure the VM service is running."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — Windows dans une fenêtre (machines virtuelles)\n"
"\n"
"Pro fournit une pile de virtualisation libre et complète : KVM "
"(l'hyperviseur du\n"
"noyau Linux lui-même), QEMU et l'application Gestionnaire de machines "
"virtuelles.\n"
"Une machine virtuelle fait tourner un tout autre système — y compris un "
"vrai\n"
"Windows — dans une fenêtre, bien isolé de vos fichiers.\n"
"\n"
"Cette configuration va :\n"
"  1. vérifier que la virtualisation de votre processeur est activée,\n"
"  2. ajouter votre utilisateur aux groupes 'libvirt' et 'kvm' (mot de passe "
"requis),\n"
"  3. s'assurer que le service de machines virtuelles est démarré."

#. TRANSLATORS: "Virtualization", "SVM" and "VT-x" are the literal words on
#. the BIOS/UEFI setup screen, which is firmware and is usually English —
#. keep them in English so the owner can find the setting. F2 and Del are
#. keyboard keys.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:63
msgid ""
"Your CPU's virtualization (Intel VT-x / AMD-V) is OFF or unsupported.\n"
"Usually it just needs switching on in the BIOS/UEFI: reboot, enter setup\n"
"(often F2 or Del), find \"Virtualization\" / \"SVM\" / \"VT-x\", enable, "
"save.\n"
"Then run this again. No changes were made."
msgstr ""
"La virtualisation de votre processeur (Intel VT-x / AMD-V) est DÉSACTIVÉE ou "
"non\n"
"prise en charge. En général il suffit de l'activer dans le BIOS/UEFI : "
"redémarrez,\n"
"accédez à la configuration (souvent F2 ou Suppr), trouvez "
"« Virtualization » / « SVM » /\n"
"« VT-x », activez, enregistrez. Puis relancez ceci. Rien n'a été modifié."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:70
msgid "CPU virtualization: available."
msgstr "Virtualisation du processeur : disponible."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:73
msgid "Enable VM support now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Activer la prise en charge des machines virtuelles maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:91
#, sh-format
msgid "User \"$ME\" added to libvirt+kvm; VM service running."
msgstr ""
"Utilisateur « $ME » ajouté à libvirt+kvm ; le service de machines virtuelles "
"tourne."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:93
msgid "Could not enable VM support (administrator access is required)."
msgstr ""
"Impossible d'activer la prise en charge des machines virtuelles (accès "
"administrateur requis)."

#. TRANSLATORS: the numbered steps are a walkthrough of Microsoft's download
#. page and of Virtual Machine Manager. The URL, "swtpm", "OVMF" and "TPM" are
#. literal. The last line is a PRIVACY promise — the owner's files stay outside
#. the VM — so keep it exact.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:102
msgid ""
"Done. One thing to know: group changes apply at your NEXT login —\n"
"log out and back in once before creating your first VM.\n"
"\n"
"To install Windows in a VM:\n"
"  1. Get the Windows ISO from Microsoft's official download page:\n"
"        https://www.microsoft.com/software-download/windows11\n"
"     (Windows in a VM runs unactivated with minor cosmetic limits, or use\n"
"      your existing license key.)\n"
"  2. Open \"Virtual Machine Manager\" from the launcher.\n"
"  3. New VM > Local install media > pick the ISO > give it 4+ GB RAM,\n"
"     2+ CPUs, 64+ GB disk. Windows 11's TPM requirement is covered — Pro\n"
"     ships swtpm (a software TPM) and UEFI firmware (OVMF).\n"
"\n"
"Your files stay outside the VM unless you share them on purpose."
msgstr ""
"Terminé. Une chose à savoir : les changements de groupe prennent effet à "
"votre\n"
"PROCHAINE connexion — déconnectez-vous et reconnectez-vous une fois avant de "
"créer\n"
"votre première machine virtuelle.\n"
"\n"
"Pour installer Windows dans une machine virtuelle :\n"
"  1. Récupérez l'ISO Windows sur la page de téléchargement officielle de "
"Microsoft :\n"
"        https://www.microsoft.com/software-download/windows11\n"
"     (Dans une machine virtuelle, Windows fonctionne non activé avec de "
"légères\n"
"      limitations esthétiques, ou utilisez votre clé de licence existante.)\n"
"  2. Ouvrez « Gestionnaire de machines virtuelles » depuis le menu.\n"
"  3. Nouvelle VM > Support d'installation local > choisissez l'ISO > donnez-"
"lui\n"
"     4 Go de RAM ou plus, 2 processeurs ou plus, 64 Go de disque ou plus.\n"
"     L'exigence TPM de Windows 11 est couverte — Pro fournit swtpm (un TPM "
"logiciel)\n"
"     et le micrologiciel UEFI (OVMF).\n"
"\n"
"Vos fichiers restent en dehors de la machine virtuelle, sauf si vous les "
"partagez\n"
"délibérément."

